<title>JAPAN: Foreigners net buyers on Japan shares via Big Four.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers on Japan shares via Big Four.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Orders placed by foreign investors through Japan's &quot;Big Four&quot; securities houses before the start of stock trading on Thursday showed a net buying stance of 200,000 shares, market sources said.</p>
<p>Foreign investors placed 7.2 million shares of buy orders against sell orders totalling 7.0 million.</p>
</text>
